-copy" aria-label="CARE Act" data-navid="37989" target="_self">CARE Act</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc" aria-label="Family Education &amp; Resource Center (FERC)" data-navid="37829" target="_self">Family Education &amp; Resource Center (FERC)</a><ul class="megamenu_level1"><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc/my-loved-one-has-been-hospitalized" aria-label="My Loved One Has Been Hospitalized" data-navid="37830" target="_self">My Loved One Has Been Hospitalized</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc/my-loved-one-has-been-arrested" aria-label="My Loved One Has Been Arrested" data-navid="37833" target="_self">My Loved One Has Been Arrested</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc/my-loved-one-needs-help" aria-label="My Loved One Needs Help" data-navid="37837" target="_self">My Loved One Needs Help</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc/talk-to-a-family-advocate" aria-label="Talk to a Family Advocate" data-navid="37838" target="_self">Talk to a Family Advocate</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc/education-center" aria-label="Education Center" data-navid="37891" target="_self">Education Center</a></li><li class="megamenu_level2"><a class="megamenu_level2" href="/community-resources/family-education-resource-center-ferc/forms-and-downloads" aria-label="Forms and Downloads" data-navid="37895" target="_self">Forms and Downloads</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="megamenu_first" id="dropdownrootitem5"