istics and Stakeholder Reports</a></li></ul></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/about-us/mission-vision-and-values" aria-label="Mission, Vision, and Values" data-navid="37491" target="_self">Mission, Vision, and Values</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/about-us/prior-authorization-metrics" aria-label="Prior Authorization Metrics" data-navid="37992" target="_self">Prior Authorization Metrics</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/about-us/psychology-internship-program" aria-label="Psychology Internship Program" data-navid="37094" target="_self">Psychology Internship Program</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/about-us/public-notices" aria-label="Public Notices" data-navid="37097" target="_self">Public Notices</a></li><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/about-us/quality-improvement" aria-label="Quality Improvement" data-navid="37099" target="_self">Quality Improvement</a></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="megamenu_first" id="dropdownrootitem6"><a class="dropdownrootitem6" href="/contact" aria-label="Contact" data-navid="37049" target="_self">Contact</a><div class="megamenu_container widthcontainer3col"><div class="inner_container"><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/contact/connect-to-kernbhrs" aria-label="Connect to KernBHRS" data-navid="37101" target="_self">Connect to KernBHRS</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/contact/family-advocate" aria-label="Family Advocate" data-navid="37102" target="_self">Family Advocate</a></li></ul><ul class="megamenu_column"><li class="megamenu_level1"><a class="megamenu_level1" href="/contact/media-inquiries" aria-label="Media Inquiries" data-navid="37490" target="_self">Media Inquiries</a></li></ul></div></div></li></ul><scr