ef='https://www.kernbhrs.org/services/substance-use/recover-inspire-support-empower-team' target='_self' aria-label='Recover, Inspire, Support &amp; Empower Team'>Recover, Inspire, Support &amp; Empower Team</a></li><li><a href='https://www.kernbhrs.org/services/substance-use/substance-use-access-line' target='_self' aria-label='Substance Use Access Line'>Substance Use Access Line</a></li><li><a href='https://www.kernbhrs.org/services/substance-use/substance-use-outpatient-treatment-team' target='_self' aria-label='Substance Use Outpatient Treatment Team'>Substance Use Outpatient Treatment Team</a></li></ul></li></ul><!--startindex-->
